mGBA source is not vendored in Phase 0.2A.

When mGBA is added under third_party/mgba/upstream, copy the exact upstream license text into this area or reference the pinned upstream LICENSE file from NOTICE.md.

Expected license family for mGBA: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0).

Before distributing builds that include mGBA:
- Preserve upstream copyright and license notices.
- Provide source for MPL-covered mGBA files and any modifications to those files.
- Keep LinkRoom application code and wrapper code clearly separated from upstream mGBA source.
- Confirm obligations with legal review.
